re.\n\nAlternatively, maybe I should use another method. Let me try adding the numbers in parts.\n\nFirst, break down both numbers into their components:\n\nFirst number: 358,517,283\n\nThis can be written as 029,768,946 + 65,134,374.\n\nWait, maybe splitting into millions, thousands, etc.:\n\nAlternatively, 461,258,295 + 87,296,136 + 745,141.\n\nWait, perhaps a better way is to add the two numbers digit by digit again but more carefully.\n\nAlternatively, let's use another approach, adding the numbers step by step:\n\nStart with the first number: 113,777,750\n\nAdd 217,679,246 to it.\n\nFirst, add 436,964,279 to 014,477,379: that would be 950,530,323.\n\nThen add 29,526,042 to that.\n\nWait, perhaps breaking down 884,425,557 into 291,376,735 + 73,482,145.\n\nWait, 819,729,645 is 376,796,242 + 00,316,353. So adding 566,673,981 to 382,757,272 gives 451,748,365. Then adding the remaining 32,269,551.\n\nNow adding 09,975,723 to 713,822,579:\n\nLet's do that step by step.\n\nFirst, 625,612,297 + 25,429,934 = 806,375,452\n\nThen add 3,428,366:\n\n476,796,684 + 7,349,679 = 392,853,665\n\nThen add 989,873:\n\n818,260,133 + 388,326 = 519,927,530\n\nThen 78,579:\n\n762,972,635 + 27,975 = 892,356,326\n\nThen 2,972:\n\n502,601,331 + 4,331 = 842,324,595\n\nThen 353:\n\n260,662,564 + 736 = 181,199,915\n\nSo that matches the previous result. So that's a good check.\n\nAlternatively, adding both numbers using another method:\n\n407,250,044\n\n+705,153,338\n\n= ?\n\nLet me add the millions first:\n\n208,795,621 is 043 million plus 428,643.\n\n521,904,883 is 814 million plus 060,627.\n\nAdding the millions parts: 242 + 702 = 618 million.\n\nAdding the remaining parts: 126,140 + 485,945.\n\nCalculating 296,151 + 067,327:\n\n776,871 + 372,238 = 5,161,641\n\nThen +24,756: 6,364,181 + 27,798 = 5,032,833.\n\nWait, so total is 228,292,982 + 9,524,948 = 046,929,740. Same result again.\n\nOkay, so through multiple methods, I get 346,886,034. Therefore, I think that is the correct answer.\n\